   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Seconds** (1 other source): Deaner plays a talk box solo after the song ends [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Mr. Would You Please Help My Pony?**: back after 81 archived shows (2868 days) [6]\n- **If You Could Save Yourself (You'd Save Us All)**: back after 247 archived shows (5331 days); rare: 11 archived performances [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **Ween2018-06-06.FLAC** (recommended): source not stated; 25 songs; 122 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: Audio sounds great and the show was described as righteous [5]\n- **ween2018-06-06.MK4-2448**: source not stated; 25 songs; 124 min [2]\n- **ween2018-06-06.ck930.flac24**: source not stated; 25 songs; 125 min [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **Ween2018-06-06.FLAC**: taped by Melissa Fry; transferred by Melissa Fry; source: Neumann AK40> Oade m248> SD 722 [1]\n- **ween2018-06-06.MK4-2448**: taped by Fireball; transferred by Fireball; source: Schoeps MK4's > Naiant Tinybox > Sony PCM-M10 > WAV (48kHz/24 bit) [2]. Also: 48kHz/24-bit master field recording captured by the uploader [2]\n- **ween2018-06-06.ck930.flac24**: taped by Mike B; transferred by Mike B; source: Beyerdynamic CK930 > Naiant IPA > Sound Devices MixPre-6 (@ 24/48) [3]",
